# Content model

Public site is **not** assembled from the page-component tree. Typed entities:

| Entity | Role |
|---|---|
| `ingest_items` | Raw imported sources (stage 1+); not public |
| `posts` | All public content after materialize |
| `events` | Legacy admin table only; public site uses invitation posts |
| `appearances` | Press / v tisku |

## Sections

| Code | Czech | Path | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ritualy` | Svatební rituály | `/svatebni-ritualy` | Business portfolio — weddings / bridal only |
| `udalosti` | Události | `/udalosti` | Current **invitations** + lasting **reports** |
| `denik` | Deník | `/denik` | Everything else lasting, chronological |

`/udalosti` lists current invitations (“nadcházející”) then lasting reports (“reportáže”). Expired invitations 404 on detail and drop from the list. Homepage plot for Události uses report photos (not invites).

Soft ingest `kind` and free keywords stay for enrichment/search. Legacy `himmelhaus` / `workshopy` / `umeni` redirect to `/denik`.

`Section::work()` (homepage plots / nav order) = rituály → události → deník.

## Controlled tags

`tags` JSON on `ingest_items` / `posts` is the source of truth for invitation framing:

| Tag | Meaning | Public fate |
|---|---|---|
| `invitation` | Open call to an upcoming/current event | path under `/udalosti`, ephemeral; hero CTA; `isInvitation` synced cache |
| `report` | Lasting write-up of an event that already happened | lasting `udalosti` listing |

Mutually exclusive. Empty tags = ordinary journal. LLM fills via KeywordAnalyzer; allowlist in `App\Classes\Content\Tags`.

## Homepage

Visual layout is in `homepage.mdc`. Text is the next **current invitation** post, else the latest lasting work post. Hero photos come from that same featured post. Then three plots: Rituály → Události (reports) → Deník.

## Invitations

Materialized from tag `invitation` (+ `startsAt` / `endsAt` / `place`), section `udalosti`. Public only while current (effective end ≥ now); expired → hidden everywhere including detail **404**. Listing `/udalosti` is current invites only (no archive). Admin legacy **Události** (`events` table) remains until removed.

## Post parts (`layoutJson.parts`)

Public post/invitation body is an ordered list in `posts.layoutJson.parts`:

| type | fields | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `text` | `html` | Sanitized HTML chunk |
| `image` | `postFileId` | One selected photo |
| `gallery` | `postFileIds` | Ordered photos |

- **`post_files`**: only photos included in the post (subset of ingest), ordered; rating/role/demote kept. Demoted/skip never enter.
- Parts reference **`postFileId`**, not ingest ids.
- **`bodyHtml` / `excerpt`**: derived — excerpt from first text part; bodyHtml = concat of text parts (search/admin fallback).
- Built by `PostMaterializer` via Gemini (`PostLayoutPlanner`): `excerpt` is for cards/listings only; body `parts` hold the complete copy (including opening lines). LLM curates photos (not all required), groups related ones into galleries, interleaves short text beats.
- Public detail (work + invitations) shares `Posts/article.twig`: one continuous centered block (header + parts + lightbox). Rematerialize existing: `MaterializePosts --args='{"existingOnly":true}'`.
- Edited in admin post form. See `App\Classes\Content\PostParts`.

## Import

Load into ingest via Katu jobs first (see `ingest.mdc`). Public `posts` come from `MaterializePosts`, not refresh jobs.

Materialize mapping: `invitation` → `udalosti` (ephemeral); `kind=wedding` → `ritualy`; `report` or `kind=workshop` → lasting `udalosti`; everything else lasting → `denik`.
